                                "text": "As of August 2026, the core tasks of translator work are becoming machine-doable, with the shift expected to land by around 2029. AI has already absorbed bulk commercial translation. What resists is certified legal & medical translation, literary & brand translation and live interpretation in high-stakes settings. The structural reason is legal liability, creative taste and accountability."
