                            "@type": "Question",
                            "acceptedAnswer": {
                                "@type": "Answer",
                                "text": "Our estimate is roughly 2029. That is the year by which the core tasks of this job are expected to be routinely machine-done in ordinary practice — after capability arrives, after employers adopt it, and after regulators allow it. It is not the year the job title disappears. Current verdict: ON THE MENU."
